name: Bounded dependency failure, cache identity refusal and frozen engine facts
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME PATH=@ART/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | automatic-draft
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Dependency inspection failed | bounded-probe-failure
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART probe-refused
wait: 22
require-live-snap: 5 Dependency inspection failed | retained-probe-failure
ask: Does a stalled installed dependency fail preparation promptly, preserve the study draft and explain recovery without publishing jobs or consuming model allowance?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: failure-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: failure-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: failure-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: failure-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: failure-40x12
keys: z Home
require-live-snap: 5 PREPARATION DETAILS | expanded-failure-40x12
expect: z form
keys: PgDn
live-snap: failure-tail-40x12
keys: z
ask: Is the failure readable by paging at all six sizes, with the return to the retained draft visible?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART oversized
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 134217728-byte | cache-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART cache-refused
wait: 22
require-live-snap: 5 134217728-byte | retained-cache-failure
ask: Does oversized comparison input stop preparation before a plan or scan job exists, retaining source and spending rather than publishing a partial identity?
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART frozen
keys: Escape
submit: campaign owned-engine-inputs
require-live-snap: 25 owned-engine-inputs | actual-frozen-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | reopened-plan
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 5 SOURCE OVERVIEW | source-overview
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS | frozen-engine-facts
expect: semgrep: located at
resize: 160x48
live-snap: engine-source-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: engine-source-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: engine-source-80x24
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-1-80x24
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-2-80x24
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-3-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp
live-snap: engine-source-60x20
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-1-60x20
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-2-60x20
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-3-60x20
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-4-60x20
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-5-60x20
keys: PgDn
live-snap: engine-source-page-6-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp
live-snap: engine-source-40x12
keys: z Home
require-live-snap: 5 z form | expanded-engine-source-40x12
expect: ↑↓/PgUp/Dn
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-1-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-2-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-3-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-4-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-5-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-6-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-7-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: reader-engine-source-page-8-40x12
keys: z
require-live-snap: 5 PLAN A STUDY | reader-return-to-form
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART inspected
ask: Can the operator inspect the selected executable's recorded path and content, with comparison facts clearly separated from engine health and coverage?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME PATH=@ART/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | no-color-restart
submit: campaign owned-engine-inputs
require-live-snap: 25 owned-engine-inputs | recovered-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | recovered-draft
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 5 SOURCE OVERVIEW | recovered-source-overview
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS | recovered-engine-facts
keys: z
require-live-snap: 5 z form | recovered-detail-reader
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_inputs.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
ask: Does no-color restart recover the same unapproved finite plan and engine facts without requesting a model, starting a scanner or expanding work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
